      "name": "per-arm-split-entries-launcher-shim",
      "description": "Split an int4 W4A16 MoE grouped GEMM into per-n-width Triton entries picked by a host launcher shim; the shim then owns each arm's launch constants.",
      "keywords": [
        "moe-grouped-gemm",
