      "name": "static-counters-do-not-price-dequant-gemm",
      "description": "Counter-guided directions (bank conflicts, VALU, barriers, occupancy, empty CTAs, traffic) returned ~1.00x or worse; time a deletion control first.",
      "keywords": [
